<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - October 23.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - October 23.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forum Victory (built 1977) 72,746 dwt del Richards Bay mid-Nov redel Liverpool $7,000 daily plus $180,000 bonus NSAC.</p>
<p>Banya (built 1996) 73,000 dwt del Cape Passero 28/10 via USG redel Far East $13,750 daily Halla Maritime.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
</text>
